WEBVTT

1
00:00:53.541 --> 00:00:56.416
Arjun, having seen Lord Krishna's Vishwarupa,

2
00:00:56.416 --> 00:00:59.833
is both joyful and disturbed.

3
00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:02.750
He is struck with wonder at the divine revelation,

4
00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:06.708
yet fearful at the intensity of the vision.

5
00:01:06.708 --> 00:01:09.750
He recognises Lord Krishna
as the supreme controller.

6
00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.250
He requests Him to reveal

7
00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:14.541
His familiar and gentle form.

8
00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:17.125
Arjun wishes to see the four-armed form

9
00:01:17.125 --> 00:01:18.208
of Narayana.

10
00:01:18.208 --> 00:01:21.000
This reveals Lord Krishna's supremacy,

11
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:24.125
as He is the original source

12
00:01:24.125 --> 00:01:25.541
of all divine forms.

13
00:01:30.375 --> 00:01:33.625
The emotions Arjun expresses are mixed.

14
00:01:33.625 --> 00:01:36.791
On one side is the joy of seeing a form

15
00:01:36.791 --> 00:01:39.833
he had never seen before,

16
00:01:39.833 --> 00:01:42.666
and on the other is the fear arising

17
00:01:42.666 --> 00:01:46.500
from its immense and overwhelming grandeur.

18
00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:49.166
The terrifying nature of the Viraat Vishwarupa

19
00:01:49.166 --> 00:01:51.125
makes him deeply uneasy.

20
00:01:51.125 --> 00:01:52.166
Knowing Lord Krishna's true

21
00:01:52.166 --> 00:01:55.208
stature, he seeks reassurance.

22
00:01:55.208 --> 00:01:57.625
He wishes to see a form

23
00:01:57.625 --> 00:02:01.166
that is majestic yet not frightening.

24
00:02:01.166 --> 00:02:04.708
That is the four-armed form of Narayana,

25
00:02:04.708 --> 00:02:07.541
adorned with a crown, mace, discus,

26
00:02:07.541 --> 00:02:10.583
conch, and lotus.

27
00:02:10.583 --> 00:02:13.833
This request makes clear that the Vishwarupa

28
00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:15.333
is awe-inspiring,

29
00:02:15.333 --> 00:02:18.208
but it is not Lord Krishna's eternal form,

30
00:02:18.208 --> 00:02:22.000
rather a vision of a temporary manifestation.

31
00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:25.250
The four-armed form of Narayana, often

32
00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:27.541
associated with Vaikuntha,

33
00:02:27.541 --> 00:02:30.458
is revered and majestic.

34
00:02:30.458 --> 00:02:33.291
Yet Arjun ultimately wishes to see Lord Krishna's

35
00:02:33.291 --> 00:02:36.000
original two-armed form,

36
00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.708
expressing a desire

37
00:02:37.708 --> 00:02:41.541
that will unfold in the coming verses.

38
00:02:41.541 --> 00:02:42.875
This moment in the Gita

39
00:02:42.875 --> 00:02:44.125
affirms Lord Krishna's

40
00:02:44.125 --> 00:02:47.916
supreme position as the source of all the devas.

41
00:02:47.916 --> 00:02:49.916
Emphasising this,

42
00:02:49.916 --> 00:02:53.000
it also confirms that He is not

43
00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:56.000
merely a cosmic power, but

44
00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:59.041
one who loves all His devotees

45
00:02:59.041 --> 00:03:02.833
and shares a direct relationship with them.

46
00:03:07.166 --> 00:03:08.500
When you

47
00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:12.416
meet a highly talented person,

48
00:03:12.416 --> 00:03:15.916
how do you feel?

49
00:03:15.916 --> 00:03:18.416
Are you always inspired,

50
00:03:18.416 --> 00:03:22.291
or does their talent sometimes

51
00:03:22.291 --> 00:03:24.625
intimidate you?

52
00:03:24.625 --> 00:03:27.375
Understand this: when someone

53
00:03:27.375 --> 00:03:31.458
impresses you with their skill,

54
00:03:31.458 --> 00:03:32.916
you admire them

55
00:03:32.916 --> 00:03:36.708
for a while.

56
00:03:36.708 --> 00:03:38.625
But throughout your life

57
00:03:38.625 --> 00:03:41.875
you remember those people

58
00:03:41.875 --> 00:03:44.625
who touch your heart,

59
00:03:44.625 --> 00:03:47.958
who are kind to you

60
00:03:47.958 --> 00:03:51.291
and care about you.

61
00:03:51.291 --> 00:03:53.333
Think,

62
00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:56.833
why do you remember someone?

63
00:03:56.833 --> 00:03:58.583
Is it because

64
00:03:58.583 --> 00:04:02.625
they were a complete personality,

65
00:04:02.625 --> 00:04:08.000
or because they understood you

66
00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:10.083
and valued you?

67
00:04:10.083 --> 00:04:15.000
My dear Arjun saw My most

68
00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:19.500
grand and awe-inspiring Vishwarupa,

69
00:04:19.500 --> 00:04:21.416
but this form

70
00:04:21.416 --> 00:04:24.958
also filled him with fear.

71
00:04:24.958 --> 00:04:28.666
This form impressed him,

72
00:04:28.666 --> 00:04:30.166
but it

73
00:04:30.166 --> 00:04:33.958
did not bring him joy.

74
00:04:33.958 --> 00:04:37.000
So he asked to see the familiar

75
00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:41.458
and friendly form,

76
00:04:41.458 --> 00:04:42.791
the one that,

77
00:04:42.791 --> 00:04:47.541
as a friend and guide,

78
00:04:47.541 --> 00:04:50.583
touched his heart.

79
00:04:50.583 --> 00:04:55.333
Developing skills in life is good,

80
00:04:55.333 --> 00:04:58.791
but true connection with others

81
00:04:58.791 --> 00:05:01.500
is determined by

82
00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:06.291
how you treat them.

83
00:05:06.291 --> 00:05:08.291
Reflect on this

84
00:05:08.291 --> 00:05:12.500
and become a person who listens,

85
00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:17.250
encourages, and stands by others.

86
00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.166
Your kindness

87
00:05:19.166 --> 00:05:22.041
and warm nature

88
00:05:22.041 --> 00:05:24.833
leave a far more lasting impression

89
00:05:24.833 --> 00:05:28.000
than any single skill you possess.

90
00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:37.750
Do you feel that for children's good future,

91
00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:41.208
they should be kept under strict discipline?

92
00:05:41.208 --> 00:05:44.250
As an elder in the family,

93
00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:47.083
you love your children

94
00:05:47.083 --> 00:05:50.125
and always wish to see them grow into responsible

95
00:05:50.125 --> 00:05:54.041
and capable individuals.

96
00:05:54.041 --> 00:05:57.583
But sometimes harsh words or strict

97
00:05:57.583 --> 00:06:01.416
discipline, in place of understanding,

98
00:06:01.416 --> 00:06:04.083
create fear.

99
00:06:04.083 --> 00:06:07.125
This fear reduces their ability

100
00:06:07.125 --> 00:06:11.875
to speak up and take initiative.

101
00:06:11.875 --> 00:06:12.833
Just as Arjun

102
00:06:12.833 --> 00:06:16.625
requested to see My gentle form,

103
00:06:16.625 --> 00:06:18.791
you too

104
00:06:18.791 --> 00:06:22.500
should show your softer side.

105
00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:26.375
Remember, raising children

106
00:06:26.375 --> 00:06:29.958
is not limited to setting rules.

107
00:06:29.958 --> 00:06:32.333
It also requires giving the warmth

108
00:06:32.333 --> 00:06:35.750
of love and the security of trust.

109
00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:36.958
So what should you do?

110
00:06:36.958 --> 00:06:40.375
When correcting a mistake, maintain a balance

111
00:06:40.375 --> 00:06:44.000
between firmness and kindness.

112
00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:45.250
Let them know

113
00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:47.541
that whatever the outcome

114
00:06:47.541 --> 00:06:49.250
of their actions,

115
00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:54.541
your love for them will always remain the same.

116
00:06:54.541 --> 00:06:57.166
Why is this important?

117
00:06:57.166 --> 00:06:59.333
A child who knows

118
00:06:59.333 --> 00:07:02.208
that they are loved

119
00:07:02.208 --> 00:07:06.500
openly seeks guidance from you.

120
00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:09.541
Strictness brings only fear,

121
00:07:09.541 --> 00:07:13.291
while kindness awakens confidence.

122
00:07:13.291 --> 00:07:17.708
Doing this, children will listen to you

123
00:07:17.708 --> 00:07:19.541
and love you.

124
00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.041
How do you impress

125
00:07:26.041 --> 00:07:29.541
people at work,

126
00:07:29.541 --> 00:07:31.375
through your work

127
00:07:31.375 --> 00:07:34.458
or through your behaviour?

128
00:07:34.458 --> 00:07:35.875
See,

129
00:07:35.875 --> 00:07:40.625
in professional life, competence is necessary,

130
00:07:40.625 --> 00:07:44.666
but skill alone is not enough.

131
00:07:44.666 --> 00:07:47.208
For true success,

132
00:07:47.208 --> 00:07:50.625
kindness is equally important.

133
00:07:50.625 --> 00:07:52.791
What often happens?

134
00:07:52.791 --> 00:07:54.958
People, through their work, knowledge,

135
00:07:54.958 --> 00:07:56.333
or achievements,

136
00:07:56.333 --> 00:08:01.041
try to impress others.

137
00:08:01.041 --> 00:08:03.000
But in truth,

138
00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:06.958
what stays in memory for long

139
00:08:06.958 --> 00:08:10.208
is the experience others had meeting you.

140
00:08:10.208 --> 00:08:13.375
Just as Arjun found My Vishwarupa

141
00:08:13.375 --> 00:08:15.958
to be very vast,

142
00:08:15.958 --> 00:08:17.750
in the same way,

143
00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:18.833
people admire

144
00:08:18.833 --> 00:08:23.750
someone's achievements, but

145
00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:28.833
can also be intimidated by their talent.

146
00:08:28.833 --> 00:08:31.375
A true and lasting impression

147
00:08:31.375 --> 00:08:35.541
is left by the leader or colleague

148
00:08:35.541 --> 00:08:41.291
who shows kindness and
genuinely cares for others. 

149
00:08:41.291 --> 00:08:43.833
So what should you do?

150
00:08:43.833 --> 00:08:46.750
When a colleague is in difficulty,

151
00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:49.166
stand by them.

152
00:08:49.166 --> 00:08:53.125
Rejoice in others' success.

153
00:08:53.125 --> 00:08:56.625
Offer constructive suggestions with wisdom.

154
00:08:56.625 --> 00:08:58.125
Doing this,

155
00:08:58.125 --> 00:09:01.583
you not only touch people's hearts,

156
00:09:01.583 --> 00:09:08.333
but both the team's work and relationships improve.

157
00:09:08.333 --> 00:09:12.500
Remember, success is not only

158
00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:14.833
in what you achieve.

159
00:09:14.833 --> 00:09:19.583
Success is also in how you inspire

160
00:09:19.583 --> 00:09:23.291
the people who work with you.

161
00:09:23.291 --> 00:09:24.625
So,

162
00:09:24.625 --> 00:09:27.166
do not only try to show

163
00:09:27.166 --> 00:09:28.958
your capability.

164
00:09:28.958 --> 00:09:33.625
Connect with kindness and respect too.

165
00:09:33.625 --> 00:09:35.250
Doing this,

166
00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:37.375
you will become

167
00:09:37.375 --> 00:09:40.625
someone people trust for the long term.
